### Key Changes & Patterns

#### 1. **Translation Key Structure**
The language file (`src/lang/index.js`) now uses this structure:
```javascript
// Product module
"product": {
  "category": {
    "entity": {
      "addFirstCategory": "...",
      "searchPlaceholder": "搜索...",
      "confirmDelete": "确定要删除吗？",
      // ... other keys
    },
    "virtual": {
      "addFirstCategory": "...",
