    }
  }
}
```
**Pattern**: `product.category.[type].[key]`

#### 2. **Critical Translation Patterns**

| Component          | Before                     | After                                      | Purpose                                  |
|--------------------|----------------------------|--------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------|
| **Confirmation Dialogs** | `"确定要删除吗?"`          | `this.$t("product.category.entity.confirmDelete")` | Standardize confirmation prompts        |
| **Success Messages**  | `"保存成功"`                | `this.$t("product.category.entity.saveSuccess")` | Replace all success notifications       |
| **Search Placeholders**| `placeholder="请输入搜索关键词"` | `:placeholder="$t('product.category.entity.searchPlaceholder')"` | Dynamic input labels |
| **Button Labels**     | `<span>新增一级类目</span>` | `<span>{{ $t("product.category.entity.addFirstCategory") }}</span>` | Internationalized buttons               |
| **Alt Attributes**    | `alt="新增"`                | `:alt="$t('product.category.entity.add')"` | Accessible UI elements                   |

#### 3. **Special Case Handling**

- **Search Result Handling**:
